{"id":8833351942343,"title":"Custom Celtic Tree of Life Quilt Set with Intertwined Roots Design","handle":"custom-tree-of-life-quilt-set-yggdrasil-bedding-5048da8f29-5048da8f29","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the ancient beauty and deep symbolism of nature with the custom Tree of Life Quilt Set by Jeminise. Featuring a stunning detailed Celtic mythology design of Yggdrasil with beautifully intertwined roots and a classic farmhouse style, this lightweight bedding set offers cozy comfort and breathable warmth for all seasons. Perfect for decorating your bedroom, lounging on the sofa, or taking on outdoor picnics and camping trips, this customizable quilt set also makes a thoughtful gift for moms, dads, and nature lovers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize various aspects of this quilt including the background, framing color, and text saying squares to create a truly unique keepsake.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoft \u0026amp; Cozy Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made from 100% soft polyester with high-quality silk floss filling, ensuring breathable, durable, and long-lasting comfort.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Multi-functional design serves perfectly as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, picnic mat, or travel gear for camping.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from multiple size options including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (102x91 inches).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOptional Pillowcases:\u003c\/strong\u003e Complete your custom bedding set by selecting none, 2, or 4 optional coordinating pillowcases (20x30 inches).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washabl